# NewUnera V2 — Icon System (Material Symbols)

All icons across `NewUnera/` MUST use **Material Symbols Outlined** inline SVG. No emojis, no Heroicons, no Lucide, no Font Awesome, no Material Icons (older family), no icon fonts, no sprites.

## Source of Truth

**Family:** Material Symbols Outlined  
**Axes:** `wght 400 · GRAD 0 · opsz 24`  
**Browse/download:** https://fonts.google.com/icons (filter: Material Symbols Outlined)

When downloading a new icon:
1. Set axes: `FILL 0` or `FILL 1` per policy below, `wght 400`, `GRAD 0`, `opsz 24`
2. Click **SVG** download — Google exports `viewBox="0 -960 960 960"`, `width="24" height="24"`, single `<path>`
3. Remove `fill="#…"` from the `<svg>` tag; replace with `fill="currentColor"`
4. Set `width` and `height` per the sizing table (§4)
5. Paste inline — **never** link to an external CDN

---

## 1. Delivery — Inline SVG Only

```html
<!-- Decorative icon (most cases) -->
<div class="impact-icon impact-icon--donations" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" fill="currentColor">
    <path d="m480-120-58-52q-101-91-167-157T150-447.5Q111-500 95.5-544T80-634q0-94 63-157t157-63q52 0 99 22t81 62q34-40 81-62t99-22q94 0 157 63t63 157q0 46-15.5 90T810-447.5Q771-395 705-329T538-172l-58 52Z"/>
  </svg>
</div>

<!-- Meaningful icon (rare — must have accessible label on the wrapper, not the SVG) -->
<button class="nav-btn" aria-label="Search">
  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M784-120 532-372q-30 24-69 38t-83 14q-109 0-184.5-75.5T120-580q0-109 75.5-184.5T380-840q109 0 184.5 75.5T640-580q0 44-14 83t-38 69l252 252-56 56ZM380-400q75 0 127.5-52.5T560-580q0-75-52.5-127.5T380-760q-75 0-127.5 52.5T200-580q0 75 52.5 127.5T380-400Z"/>
  </svg>
</button>
```

Rules:
- `fill="currentColor"` always on the `<svg>` element — color is controlled by CSS on the wrapper
- `aria-hidden="true"` on **decorative** icons (activity icons, impact icons, action icons — all the icon wells); the wrapper's `aria-label` or visible text provides the label
- For truly **meaningful** icons with no adjacent text label, put `aria-hidden="true"` on the `<svg>` and an `aria-label` on the interactive parent element

