## 2. FILL Axis Policy

| Context | FILL | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Impact card icon wells (`.impact-icon`) | **1 (filled)** | Large semantic icons; filled reads as a category token |
| Activity / transaction row icons (`.activity-icon`, `.transaction-icon`) | **1 (filled)** | Status identity at a glance; filled = recognized faster |
| Wallet stat tiles (`.stat-icon`) | **1 (filled)** | Decorative KPI accent |
| Payment / method chips (`.method-icon`, `.method-icon-wrap`) | **1 (filled)** | Method recognition |
| Prerequisite icons (`.prereq-icon`) | **1 (filled)** | Checklist items; filled = concrete |
| Success hero icons, completion states | **1 (filled)** | Filled circle/check = done |
| Error / failure state icons | **1 (filled)** | Filled error = urgent, unambiguous |
| Warning badges (`⚠️` replacements) | **1 (filled)** | Filled warning triangle = known Material convention |
| Quick action card icons (`.action-card-icon`) | **0 (outlined)** | Lighter, functional glyphs on card surfaces |
| Nav glyphs, breadcrumb arrows | **0 (outlined)** | Minimal chrome weight |
| Stepper checkmarks, progress checks | **0 (outlined)** | Stroked check = precise/technical |
| Inline button icons | **0 (outlined)** | Paired with text; outlined is quieter |
| Micro-glyphs inside pill badges (`.activity-type-badge svg`, etc.) | **0 (outlined)** | Tiny size; outlined reads at 9–12px |
| Empty-state illustrations | **0 (outlined)** | Illustrated feel; lighter |
| Lightning / fast badges (`.lightning-badge`, `.lightning-badge-lg`) | **1 (filled)** | Filled bolt = energy, speed |
| Tip / lightbulb hints (`.tip-icon`) | **1 (filled)** | Filled lightbulb = insight |

