## 3. Semantic Color Assignment

Each brand color carries a distinct cognitive meaning. Icon color follows this meaning via `color:` on the wrapper element (icon inherits via `fill="currentColor"`).

### 3.1 Contrast Audit (WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.11 — 3:1 minimum for non-text)

| Token | Hex | Contrast on white | Permitted as icon ink? |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--brand-deep-blue` | `#173d47` | **10.4:1** | ✅ Yes — any surface |
| `--fin-up` | `#1a7a5e` | **4.75:1** | ✅ Yes — any light surface |
| `--brand-purple` | `#6a5770` | **5.8:1** | ✅ Yes — any light surface |
| `--brand-red` | `#ab5770` | **4.4:1** | ✅ Yes — any light surface |
| `--warning` | `#b8a030` | **2.45:1** | ❌ No — well background only; use Deep Blue ink inside warning wells |
| `--brand-light-blue` | `#90c2b8` | **1.88:1** | ❌ No — well background only |
| `--brand-earth` | `#cec4b8` | **1.7:1** | ❌ No — well background only |
| `--brand-yellow` | `#ffffab` | **1.04:1** | ❌ No on light bg — well background only on light surfaces; ink only on `--brand-deep-blue` backgrounds |
| `--brand-yellow` on `--brand-deep-blue` | | **10.0:1** | ✅ Yes — on deep-blue nav/chips only |
| `--brand-white` on `--brand-deep-blue` | | **20.7:1** | ✅ Yes — on deep-blue backgrounds only |
| `--brand-black` on white | | **21:1** | ✅ Yes — on white/light chips only |

**The Well-Color Rule:** Colors that fail as icon ink (Yellow, Light Blue, Earth, Warning) express their semantic meaning through the **icon chip background** instead. The glyph inside always uses a passing-contrast ink (Deep Blue):

```css
/* Correct — "speed/reward" meaning via yellow chip background */
.activity-icon.reward {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-yellow) 30%, var(--brand-white));
    color: var(--brand-deep-blue);   /* 10:1 on the yellow-tinted chip */
}
/* WRONG — yellow ink on white card: 1.04:1, fails 3:1 */
.activity-icon.reward { color: var(--brand-yellow); }
```

**SC 1.4.1 — Color alone must not be the sole signal.** Every semantic color must be paired with:
- A **distinct icon shape** (`check_circle` ≠ `error` ≠ `warning` — never the same shape across semantic states)
- An **accessible label** (`aria-label` on parent or adjacent visible text)
- **Well/border treatment** to reinforce the distinction

### 3.2 Color Meanings

| Color | Token | Meaning | Icon Application |
|---|---|---|---|
| Deep Blue `#173d47` | `--brand-deep-blue` | Authority, institution, trust, primary anchor | Default icon ink; nav glyphs; in-progress/processing; bank/settlement; security (lock, shield, verified_user) |
| Yellow `#ffffab` | `--brand-yellow` | Energy, speed, reward, warmth, active | **Well chip** for lightning/bolt (instant), lightbulb/tip, star/reward; Yellow as **ink** only on deep-blue chips (nav badge, dark chip) |
| Cloud Blue `#ebfcf5` | `--brand-cloud-blue` | Calm, spacious, informational | **Well background** for neutral/info icons; never icon ink |
| White `#ffffff` | `--brand-white` | Clarity, contrast on dark | Icon ink on deep-blue nav and primary-card dark surfaces |
| Black `#000000` | `--brand-black` | Precision, weight, high contrast | Icon ink inside white chips on primary action cards only |
| Red/Mauve `#ab5770` | `--brand-red` | Caution, loss, passion/heart, urgency | **Ink direct** on light surfaces: error/failed, outflows, cancel, donation heart |
| Purple `#6a5770` | `--brand-purple` | Sophistication, social, secondary | **Ink direct**: swap/convert, social-impact lives/global, secondary paths |
| Light Blue `#90c2b8` | `--brand-light-blue` | Soft, informational, muted positive | **Well background** for info/neutral; never icon ink |
| Earth `#cec4b8` | `--brand-earth` | Warmth, history, record-keeping | **Well background** for historical/audit/calendar; never icon ink |
| Fin-Up `#1a7a5e` | `--fin-up` | Financial positive, growth, success | **Ink direct**: completion checks, inflows, yield/growth, success state |
| Warning `#b8a030` | `--warning` | Time-sensitive, caution, pending | **Well background** (`--surface-warning-soft`) only; icon ink inside = Deep Blue |

