| Impact/KPI: portfolio/balance | `--brand-deep-blue` | purple-tinted `color-mix(--brand-purple 16%, white)` | Institutional |
| Impact/KPI: yield/growth | `--fin-up` | cloud-blue tinted well | Financial positive |
