| Transaction row: in/receive | `--fin-up` | `--fin-up-bg` | Financial inflow |
| Transaction row: out/send | `--brand-red` (`--error`) | `--error-bg` | Outflow |
| Transaction row: pending | `--brand-deep-blue` | `--surface-warning-soft` yellow well | Warning via well |
