| Stat icons: yield/growth | `--fin-up` | — | Financial positive |
| Stat icons: activity/social | `--brand-purple` | — | Social/secondary |

### 3.4 CSS Patterns

```css
/* Impact/KPI icons — each card type gets distinct ink + background */
.impact-icon--portfolio { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-purple) 16%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-deep-blue); }
.impact-icon--yield     { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-cloud-blue) 45%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--fin-up); }
.impact-icon--donations { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-red) 12%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-red); }
.impact-icon--lives     { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-light-blue) 22%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-purple); }

/* Transaction row icons — semantic ink */
.transaction-icon.in         { background: var(--fin-up-bg);  color: var(--fin-up);           border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--fin-up) 25%, transparent); }
.transaction-icon.out        { background: var(--error-bg);   color: var(--error);             border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-red) 25%, transparent); }
.transaction-icon.pending    { background: var(--surface-warning-soft); color: var(--brand-deep-blue); border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--warning) 30%, transparent); }
.transaction-icon.donation   { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-red) 12%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-red); border: 2px solid rgba(171,87,112,0.3); }
.transaction-icon.yield      { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-cloud-blue) 40%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--fin-up); border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--fin-up) 20%, transparent); }
.transaction-icon.convert,
.transaction-icon.conversion { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-purple) 14%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-purple); border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-purple) 30%, transparent); }
.transaction-icon.reward     { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-yellow) 30%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-deep-blue); border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-yellow) 60%, transparent); }

/* Lightning badge — yellow well, deep-blue ink on light surfaces */
.lightning-badge {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-yellow) 55%, var(--brand-earth));
    color: var(--brand-deep-blue);
}
/* Lightning badge on dark chip (e.g. success hero on deep-blue circle) — yellow ink */
.success-icon-animated .lightning-badge,
.success-icon-animated-lg .lightning-badge-lg {
    color: var(--brand-deep-blue);   /* deep blue ink on yellow-tinted badge */
}

/* Activity icons — semantic variants */
.activity-icon.donation { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-red) 12%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--brand-red); border: 2px solid rgba(171,87,112,0.25); }
.activity-icon.yield    { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-cloud-blue) 40%, var(--brand-white)); color: var(--fin-up); border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--fin-up) 20%, transparent); }

/* Stat icons per type */
.stat-icon.stat-icon--balance  { color: var(--brand-deep-blue); }
.stat-icon.stat-icon--yield    { color: var(--fin-up); }
.stat-icon.stat-icon--activity { color: var(--brand-purple); }
.stat-icon.stat-icon--lives    { color: var(--brand-purple); }
```

