## 4. CSS Theming — fill, not stroke

Material Symbols are **filled path** SVGs. All CSS rules that previously used `stroke` on icon SVGs must use `fill` instead.

```css
/* CORRECT — Material Symbols */
.action-card-icon svg       { fill: currentColor; }   /* inherits from wrapper color */
.action-card-icon           { color: var(--brand-deep-blue); }

.action-card.primary .action-card-icon svg { fill: var(--brand-black); }
.unera-cad-hub-icon svg     { fill: var(--brand-deep-blue); }
.activity-icon svg          { fill: currentColor; }

/* WRONG — do not use stroke on Material Symbols */
/* .action-card-icon svg { stroke: currentColor; }  ← remove */
/* .unera-cad-hub-icon svg { stroke: var(--brand-deep-blue); } ← remove */
```

Remove these from any icon `<svg>` elements:
- `stroke="currentColor"`
- `stroke-width="2"` (or any stroke-width)
- `fill="none"`

---

## 5. Sizing Table

The **inner SVG** `width` / `height` is set directly on the `<svg>` element. The wrapper well controls the clickable/visual area.

| Wrapper well size | `<svg>` width/height | Typical context |
|---|---|---|
| 64 × 64 | `32` | `.action-card-icon` (Quick Actions) |
| 56 × 56 | `28` | `.impact-icon` (Impact cards) |
| 52 × 52 | `26` | `.unera-cad-hub-icon` |
| 48 × 48 | `24` | `.activity-icon`, `.transaction-icon` |
| 40 × 40 | `20` | Smaller status icons |
| 32 × 32 | `18` | `.stat-icon`, `.option-icon` |
| 24 × 24 | `14` | Small inline icons |
| ≤ 16 × 16 | `10`–`12` | Micro-glyphs inside pill badges |
| Standalone inline text context | `16`–`20` | `.view-all-link` arrow, nav arrow |

