| 📈 | Yield, positive trend | `trending_up` | 1 |
| 🌍 | Lives impacted, global | `public` | 1 |
| 💰 | Portfolio, balance, money-in | `savings` | 1 |
| 🏠 | Home, centre | `home` | 1 |
| 💳 | Credit/debit card method | `credit_card` | 1 |
| 🏦 | Bank, settlement, bank transfer | `account_balance` | 1 |
| 🔗 | On-chain path, link | `link` | 0 |
| ⚡ | Instant, lightning, fast | `bolt` | 1 (wells) / 0 (action cards) |
| ⚠️ | Warning, risk notice | `warning` | 1 |
| ❌ | Failed, cancelled | `close` in colored well; `error` for system | 1 |
