| 👤 | Recipient, user, person | `person` | 1 (row icons) / 0 (action card) |
| 🎁 | Reward, gift | `redeem` | 1 |
| 🪙 | Token, HUMA coin | `paid` | 1 |
| 💸 | Fee, payment detail | `payments` | 1 |
