## 8. What NOT to Do

- ❌ **No emojis** in product HTML under `NewUnera/` — they are system-font-dependent, inconsistent cross-platform, and incompatible with brand color control
- ❌ **No `stroke`** on Material Symbols SVGs — they are filled paths; use `fill="currentColor"` only
- ❌ **No `fill="none"`** + `stroke="currentColor"` pattern — that is Heroicons/Lucide style
- ❌ **No `stroke-width`** attribute on Material Symbols SVGs
- ❌ **No Heroicons, Lucide, Font Awesome, Feather** — only Material Symbols Outlined
- ❌ **No Material Icons** (the older, non-variable family at `fonts.googleapis.com/icon`) — only **Material Symbols**
- ❌ **No icon fonts / CDN icon libraries** — inline SVG only
- ❌ **No SVG sprites or `<use>`** — paste SVG inline
- ❌ **No mixing** of Outlined + Rounded + Sharp variants — Outlined only
- ❌ **No custom hand-drawn paths** for icons that have a Material Symbols equivalent
- ❌ **No hardcoded fill colors** on the `<svg>` or `<path>` — use `fill="currentColor"` and control with CSS `color:`

