## 9. Checkmark Alignment

The canonical stroked checkmark (`.cursor/rules/newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc`) aligns to the Material Symbols `check` FILL=0 path. All checkmarks in stepper wells, processing trackers, and step-done states use:

```html
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" fill="currentColor">
  <path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/>
</svg>
```

